# Slice 282 probe: `x: var\i` with a declared x, under the data of an explicit call: a number place takes the value the path reads at run time.  Entry 7.
Work:
    int: got 0
    got: var\i
end: Work
Data:
    int: i 6
    int: got 9
end: Data
int: code 7
call: Work Data
if: Data\got != 6
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
